    "markdown": "# Wide vs Long\n![](/images/wide_long_box.png){style=\"width:250px; background: white; border-radius:5px; border: white solid 5px\" fig-align=\"center\"}\n\nWide vs long coding refers to how you layout your code.\nIt does not change how your code functions, but it can effect how easy it is to parse/read code.\n\n## Wide\n![](/images/width_box.png){style=\"width:200px; background: white; border-radius:5px; border: white solid 5px\" fig-align=\"center\"}\n\nIf your command/<u id='function_tooltip'>__function__</u> is only on one line then you were using __wide__ coding. \nThis is good with short commands and <u id='function_tooltip'>__functions__</u> but is not very suitable for longer commands. Below are examples of long commands over one line each.\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n#Create a data frame called df\ndf <- data.frame(one = c(2,4,6), three = c(6,12,18), five = c(10,20,30), row.names = c(\"Two\", \"Four\", \"Six\"))\n#Create a data frame called beach_df_2\nbeach_df_2 <- data.frame(Crab = c(10,1,1,4), Oystercatcher = c(5,6,4,4), Sandpiper = c(1,1,2,3), Starfish = c(3,3,7,4), row.names = c(\"Formby\",\"West Kirby\",\"Crosby\",\"New Brighton\"))\n```\n:::\n\n\n## Long\n![](/images/length_box.png){style=\"width:200px; background: white; border-radius:5px; border: white solid 5px\" fig-align=\"center\"}\n\nCompare the above with the below __long__ coding where arguments are separated by new lines.\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n#Create a data frame called df\ndf <- data.frame(one = c(2,4,6), \n                 three = c(6,12,18), \n                 five = c(10,20,30), \n                 row.names = c(\"Two\", \"Four\", \"Six\"))\n#Create a data frame called beach_df_2\nbeach_df_2 <- data.frame(Crab = c(10,1,1,4), \n                         Oystercatcher = c(5,6,4,4),\n                         Sandpiper = c(1,1,2,3),\n                         Starfish = c(3,3,7,4), \n                         row.names = c(\"Formby\",\"West Kirby\",\n                                       \"Crosby\",\"New Brighton\"))\n```\n:::\n\n\nHopefully you will agree with me that the long coding is a lot easier and quicker to read.\n\nIf you are interested in more about R style guides I would recommend looking at the following resource: <https://style.tidyverse.org/>.\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-f21f56d7fed7355a31bf\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-f21f56d7fed7355a31bf\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"operator_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"+, -, /, *, etc.\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-c55d711dd2cebbddd76d\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-c55d711dd2cebbddd76d\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"variable_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Container of an R object with a name\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-c19e029137ac3bba34f1\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-c19e029137ac3bba34f1\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"function_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Named block of code that performs a specific task\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-b98c7c4e8654abea6074\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-b98c7c4e8654abea6074\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"class_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Object data type, e.g. integer, double, string, and logical\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-b0d5b2d7921b2c2fca7f\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-b0d5b2d7921b2c2fca7f\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"data_structure_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Object structure type, e.g. scalar, vector, and data frame\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-6bdb72e7f9b8405e18d1\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-6bdb72e7f9b8405e18d1\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"integer_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Number without decimal points\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-9bc1c99b36e891b584a0\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-9bc1c99b36e891b584a0\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"double_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Number with decimal points\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-f27435680e3f32b7deb3\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-f27435680e3f32b7deb3\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"string_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Text\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-87eaf8d25b6aa596d475\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-87eaf8d25b6aa596d475\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"logical_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"TRUE or FALSE\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-5f0c47c22079169c2eff\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-5f0c47c22079169c2eff\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"scalar_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"A single value in a object\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-a79b8cbf6bd366295023\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-a79b8cbf6bd366295023\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"vector_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Homogenous 1-dimensional data structure\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-8b86713b2f5635d24841\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-8b86713b2f5635d24841\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"matrix_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Homogeneous 2-dimensional data structure\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-99602055fa674265d222\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-99602055fa674265d222\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"data_frame_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Heterogeneous 2-dimensional data structure. Each column is homogeneous\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-ec489ed8f9e3e6367c00\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-ec489ed8f9e3e6367c00\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"assignment_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"<-\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n",
